---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "民泊の手続きの記事"
description: "民泊（住宅宿泊事業）の届出や、旅館業の許可について、はじめての方にも分かるように解説した記事の一覧です。"
navActive: articles
---
{% set root = page.url | relRoot %}
<div class="article-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ root }}../">トップ</a> ／ 民泊の記事</div>
    <h1 class="article-hero-title">民泊の手続きの記事</h1>
    <div class="article-hero-meta"><span>民泊の届出や旅館業の許可について、はじめての方にも分かるように解説します。</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="services-section" id="articles">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="post-list post-list--full" id="post-list">
      {% for article in collections.articles %}
      <li class="post-item" data-cat="{{ article.data.category }}">
        <a href="{{ root }}{{ article.url | noLeadSlash }}">
          <span class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ article.data.datePublished | isoDate }}">{{ article.data.datePublished | cardDate }}</time>{% if article.data.category %}<span class="post-cat">{{ article.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
          <span class="post-title">{{ article.data.title }}</span>
          {% if article.data.description %}<span class="post-desc">{{ article.data.description }}</span>{% endif %}
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% include "partials/article-contact.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>
